  "R intervals come from confint.default() (Wald), not profile-likelihood confint().",
  "phit reports the covariance at the converged coefficients; R glm() evaluates it at the last IRLS iterate. With the tight fitting tolerances used here the difference is negligible. See the R compatibility page for details.",
  "Without an intercept, the null deviance uses a mean of one."
 ],
